      "correction_note": "att here, the level of explanations are just sad",
      "backchannel_events": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "speaker": "dgac_edgardo_ortiz",
      "start": 149.5,
      "end": 156.0,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "text": "tenemos un procedimiento la línea que se sigue usted acaba de leer lo que le estamos explicando Latam es el transportador Latam tiene que ver",
      "reviewed": true,
      "correction_note": "also here. trying to use something the passenger read to then imply that the passenger did not understand (again)",
